                        


SCP-5254

Object class: Euclid

Security level: 4

Special Containment Procedures:

SCP-5254 is to be kept under 500MW UV rays, SCP-5254's containment chamber is to be guarded by three security guards at all times and is not to be let out. SCP-5254 is to be doused in liquid state mercury as to prevent it from breaching containment.

Description:

SCP-5254 is a creature that was found in the basement of a house situated in ██████,██████

and is not to be entered by any personnel unless sent to guard SCP-5254 or to feed SCP-5254 a Class-D personnel. If SCP-5254 has already been fed or the guards have already arrived, they are to be terminated immediately for trying to access classified information. In the event of a containment breach, all personnel are to equip 5MW UV lamps and protective gear to nullify attacks from SCP-5254.

SCP-5254 is weak to lights, causing its containment chamber to have a light source of 32 watts infrared lighting, if SCP-5254 is caught in a light of 700MW or higher, it will freeze in place making containment easy.

If an electrical blackout occurs all personnel are to grab a 5MW lights and form the ancient Rome formation testudo (Latin for tortoise) and keep in that formation until the electrical blackout is resolved.







                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
